    "War": "Damn bruh i wonder what's the point. The people in power draw lines and the soldiers die. The ego of the ones in power and everything. Yet we can't take it for granted they are all given for a reason.",
    "I've realised that life is not easy. Cause of certain characters and their upbringing you might feel it's easy. Like you look at a old hero dancing and feel it's easy but it ain't. It requires a lot of pratice. You can't be others. Even the movies you see as mere entertainment require a lot of planning. But you can't fathom it. You can't accept that you are average. You see a item girl dancing and differentiate yourself from her by calling her item girl. But it is so hard to be her. Let's stoop even lower. You might look at a pornstar and call her cheap. But it requires so much skill to be her. You are average. But the twist is that life gives you certain things and when you catch them and you WILL. Even freaking gaming or just sitting and watching movies. You develop something which you might feel as inferior. But it isn't. You have things that others only dream of having. But a human mind always compares and rationalises for not having it. Every small moment on this earth matters. Even if you are a beggar on the sidewalk, you see a world that no one sees. That is worth living. Rushil you are slowly understanding this. Let's say dance. You think it's easy and think you are the best. But as you slowly dance you realise how hard it actually is. For some people it may come easily even for me too but it only becomes showable by prectice. People practice unknownigly think about it. You don't see it. Even the small trips your dad takes you is a very big thing you don't understand. No one talks about the success of commen men. Everyday is a success for them. They have to snatch their happiness. A middle class man who is happy has to find ways and push himself to be happy. Everyone is living a hard life. You think you with your anxiety and inferiority complex are missing out on life and it's experiences or whatever. But you only get what you are worthy of. Obviously knowing all this i am not telling to sit at home. Keep doing. Keep doing whatever life throws at you. If you find something you believe in.. While going on this path. Then hold on to it. Ignore everyone. The world turns someday. You might feel you are doing a boring software job and everything is depressing. But there is gratitude. Let's forget gratitude for a second. Yes your life to YOU is depressing. Comparatively you should feel gratitude. But gratitude is bullshit. Cause everyone is living the same life. Then your life is training you for something unknowingly. You might not know it. One day the chance shows itself and then you'll see the big picture. It's crazy. But persistence is the only answer. Just living doing whatever you want. One day at a time. Until you see the bigger picture": "It's all about living man. Even the people judging and the hate. The negativity. The war. Everything has a meaning . You don't see yet. Life has no meaning. Cause meaning restricts life. The meaning m",
