    "Wtf is dharma bruh?? Who knows at night these kings stripped women in court and did shit.... That draupadi incident only matters cause she is rich and a queen.... It's not abt the girl as society interprets it. Society even says god will be there to save women and shit. But nah.... You should be rich girl. Not only rich but a queen. Think about it deeply. It's about ego and war. Nothing to do with girl. Nothing to do with her being naked in front of everyone. At that time it wasn't such a tabooo as we see it with our lens today. Also like she was literally shared without her consent bruh and this court incident is suddenly wrong. God took a side and the other side is just wrong now and they have to suffer. I get it public and she surrenders.. But haven't many women and men before her? If god is good why is there suffering on earth. It is just selective bullshit. Like a political party. Shit keeps happening but one of that shit is in public eye they step and use it too win next election.": "Also Yes even though i have such a large world view and think a lot and can tell people a lot of things. I shouldn't explain them stuff. They should be smart enough to understand. I sometimes find mys"
